# DUKES UP: ghouls come on when the view scrolls past their mark, whether
# or not the last lot are still standing; some wait (eating, sitting,
# dancing, asleep) until you come near or hit them. At a lock-screen the
# view stops until nobody is left, then GO. At the end of a section the way
# on opens once the street is clear. The view never scrolls back.
game dukesup
wait 5
cheat pick 1 0
cheat run 1
cheat god
cheat freeze
expect cam == 0
expect kind_1 == 0
hold RIGHT 220
expect cam >= 40
expect kind_1 >= 2
# two shamblers on, and more come as the view moves on, the first two still up
hold RIGHT 200
expect cam >= 150
expect kind_1 >= 3
# the feeder at 470 waits, eating, until somebody comes near
expect foe5_state == 12
expect foe5_mode == 1
# the view never goes back
hold LEFT 60
expect cam >= 150
# the lock-screen at 330
hold RIGHT 400
expect cam == 330
expect cam_lock == 330
hold RIGHT 200
expect cam == 330
cheat clear
wait 2
expect cam_lock == -1
hold RIGHT 60
expect cam > 330
# the end of the street: the way on opens once it's clear
cheat clear
cheat cam 1270
cheat pos 1 1400 140
wait 2
cheat clear
hold RIGHT 200
wait 2
cheat clear
hold RIGHT 400
expect sec == 1
